{"h":3396,"w":2400,"lines":[{"y":0.03481993163996977,"h":0.020541699952034476,"t":"Sample Writing answers","x":0.079848569096787447,"w":0.23325810750325521,"c":1},{"t":"TEST 4, WRITING TASK 2","h":0.02571371503095321,"x":0.079948843043116349,"c":1,"w":0.36280403137207035,"y":0.080201176273736907},{"t":"This is an answer written by a candidate who achieved a Band 4.0 score.","h":0.015991796172268868,"w":0.69753087361653643,"y":0.12063953473741451,"x":0.080246908757372351,"c":1},{"x":0.35802468606826088,"t":"The Advanteg of Driveles Vehicles","y":0.14811542988404602,"w":0.28395062764485679,"h":0.019140164899882239,"c":1},{"x":0.082230661388277046,"y":0.17578276391361636,"h":0.018917443193451455,"w":0.82731765747070318,"c":1,"t":"First of all number of vehicles is incarese day atter day which means ever day the world gets more"},{"c":1,"x":0.080246922618302199,"y":0.19758539482741577,"w":0.82921808878580727,"h":0.01472320376914027,"t":"drivers then betore. If we admite that alots of people preter to use public transport we do not have"},{"t":"any doubts that many people use the vehicles because of advantags of driving.","y":0.21643109526674742,"x":0.080246923683035765,"w":0.65637858072916666,"h":0.019140164899882128,"c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.82098765055338552,"t":"The history shows us that the human like to move from place to another for many reasns and the","x":0.080246915705327618,"h":0.01897067596830937,"y":0.24411071897743475},{"h":0.021973725623320561,"x":0.080186652484957599,"y":0.26326256324481911,"c":1,"t":"always fell pleased when the rid. This days people have all kind of vehicles bicks, cars, motor...etc","w":0.81493291219075525},{"x":0.080063716505866203,"y":0.28455416597165395,"h":0.020836961564242751,"c":1,"w":0.37073880513509117,"t":"because they all have a different advantage."},{"h":0.018950132093665362,"c":1,"y":0.31389870471922698,"w":0.79629628499348948,"t":"people needs also can not meet at be found in one pleace for that reason people need to move","x":0.080246919181452561},{"y":0.33421672555398896,"t":"from a plece to another place to meet thier needs which means the advantage of moving from point","w":0.84156377156575513,"x":0.080246920791316068,"c":1,"h":0.018980948467277048},{"c":1,"t":"to anther point will be exist for ever.","w":0.31275721232096354,"h":0.017667844522968101,"x":0.080246908129431777,"y":0.35600706731177167},{"t":"World has bee changed a lot and many people have got great jobs with big salaries. The can easly","w":0.82098765055338541,"c":1,"y":0.38368669045637405,"x":0.080246915365293603,"h":0.018929588219021465},{"x":0.080246915061366719,"y":0.40253239123802353,"w":0.78189300537109385,"h":0.020432724969547178,"c":1,"t":"fund thier vehicl and because people get feeling boring if the used to some thing they always"},{"y":0.42356672189791122,"x":0.08009111488357433,"t":"pereter to chang thier vehicle from time to time.","c":1,"h":0.020501090724841631,"w":0.41588648478190104},{"w":0.82921808878580716,"c":1,"t":"Finally I think it is very hard to believe that the driverless vehicles with outweigh the disadvantages","x":0.082304535791934183,"y":0.45200235583923198,"h":0.018927876323075465},{"c":1,"t":"because people always find drive more and more give thier life meaning and add more advantage","w":0.82098765055338552,"h":0.02041218109490317,"x":0.080246915832703769,"y":0.47232037721053577},{"h":0.020442997468514856,"y":0.49263839805596787,"w":0.81481480916341142,"t":"to it all kind of vehicles give happeness to a lot of people that they can not think about lossing it","c":1,"x":0.08024691641032651},{"t":"Here is the examiner's comment:","x":0.082304530294837502,"w":0.31481480916341142,"h":0.015988371257085521,"c":1,"y":0.52906976769994563},{"w":0.76131688435872391,"h":0.016024324441826665,"t":"Most of the ideas in this response are not relevant to the question. It mainly talks","x":0.12962962377329518,"y":0.56537102453222676,"c":1},{"x":0.12748102164868841,"y":0.58126624333947452,"h":0.02022744797705478,"c":1,"t":"about the need people have to go from place to place and how people like different","w":0.78826772054036454},{"t":"types of transport. However, there is a position expressed in the final paragraph.","y":0.60029069786130262,"x":0.12757202439426985,"w":0.76337448120117202,"c":1,"h":0.017494932361148963},{"t":"A title is not required in Task 2.","c":1,"x":0.12757202200717518,"h":0.01598837238037687,"w":0.29629628499348959,"y":0.61918604636211594},{"h":0.01750691675606264,"t":"There is some attempt to organise the ideas and there are some basic cohesive","x":0.12757202766214618,"w":0.75925923665364592,"c":1,"y":0.65400471130486615},{"h":0.017667844522968101,"w":0.69753087361653643,"c":1,"x":0.12757201166386684,"t":"devices [First of all | Finally], but there is inaccuracy and a general lack of","y":0.67137809200045051},{"c":1,"t":"coherence. There is no clear progression.","y":0.6904069766091927,"w":0.39506172180175786,"h":0.01454001966999896,"x":0.13168724598964615},{"h":0.016014052504504606,"y":0.72526501740440563,"x":0.12962962544517978,"w":0.74897120157877617,"c":1,"t":"There is a high density of error in the use of vocabulary in terms of spelling and"},{"w":0.76131688435872391,"h":0.016195524146054185,"x":0.12962962360718697,"t":"word choice [easly fund thier vehicl | perefer to chang thier]. Sentence structures","y":0.74263839809653309,"c":1},{"h":0.016195524146054185,"c":1,"y":0.76148409914633497,"x":0.12962963612204409,"t":"are very limited, although there are some attempts at subordinate clauses [because","w":0.79012344360351561},{"y":0.77906976729312405,"h":0.01598837238037687,"c":1,"x":0.12757201447552585,"t":"they all have a different advantage].","w":0.34567901611328122},{"c":1,"t":"138","y":0.90988372074727186,"w":0.037037035624186185,"x":0.082304527414244349,"h":0.013081395583944722}]}